                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this game 2 years ago when it was released in early access and really enjoyed it. The problem is this is just another early access game that was rushed into full release too early. There are just too many bugs in the game right now to recommend this game as is. \n\nI will change my recommendation it a yes if the bugs get fixed.",
